3.2 Window 2: Interoperability and semantic trustworthiness

Window 2 concerns whether the generated RDF has consistent meaning and can be interpreted and
reused by other systems. The current mapper does generate N-Triples, but RDF serialisation alone
does not establish semantic interoperability.

