3.4 Window 4: Encryption and data protection

Window 4 concerns protection of sensitive information during storage, processing and transfer. The
code demonstrates HTTPS for the AllegroGraph connection, so the analysis should not claim that
the entire application has no encryption. The verified concern is the handling of local raw files and
the absence of application-level file encryption in the inspected code.

