JSON files or confirm the security of other deployment paths.

4 Methodology based on the Data Transformation Process

Gebremeskel et al. describe a Data Transformation Process for the HDS using seven functions:
capture, validation, de-identification, mapping, provenance, persistence and identification, and
registration and exposure [12]. These functions provide a useful way to organise the SafeVoice
assessment.

